{
  "version": 1,
  "notice": "Expected outcomes for each sample email, for the DETERMINISTIC parts of the pipeline only (email normalising, identity check, routing gate). 'intent', 'flags', 'vulnerability_flags', 'priority' and 'complaint_indicator' are what the classifier and empathy agents are EXPECTED to return: they are LLM judgements and are not tested here. 'backstop_alone' is what the routing gate does from the message text alone if the classifier sets no flag at all.",
  "scenarios": [
